OL,3,GNEWSAFinal weeks for Gabriel's Wharf
OL,4,Aafter almost 40 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts not-for-profit owner, Coin Street,
OL,7,Fsaid the site would be demolished and
OL,8,Fregenerated, with business owners
OL,9,Frequired to leave by 27 September. It
OL,10,Fplans to build a nursing home on the
OL,11,Fsite in 10 to 15 years' time.
